        {
          "type": "kotak",
          "title": "Four questions that get people telling stories",
          "items": [
            "**מָה עָשִׂיתָ אֶתְמוֹל?** *(mah asita etmol?)* — what did you do yesterday? To a woman: עָשִׂית.",
            "**אֵיפֹה הָיִיתָ?** *(eifoh hayita?)* — where were you?",
            "**אֵיךְ הָיָה?** *(eikh hayah?)* — how was it? The answer can be as short as הָיָה נֶחְמָד.",
            "**מָתַי הִגַּעְתָּ?** *(matai higa'ta?)* — when did you arrive?"
          ]
        }
      ]
